<title>UK: Lebanon sets $100 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Lebanon sets $100 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEBANON</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  PRINCIPAL GUARANTEED BY WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    02.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  62.5 BP   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+100 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ++	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  LEBANON   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  12.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT MAY 2007 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES   ++ 1K-10K FOR REG S, 1K-100K FOR 144A, 1K-250K FOR PP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
